### Page 1 of 2

```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

April 21, 2021
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #E-27-21 for furnishing Four (4) New Kubota RTV-X1100C
Utility Vehicles, for the City of Cheyenne, Community Recreation & Events
Department
______________________________________________
One (1) bidder responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached.

The One (1) Bid was received from:
1. Heartland Kubota, LLC.  Sheridan, Wyoming.

The bid was reviewed by Jason Sanchez (CRE) and  Sam Payne (CRE).  Their recommendation is
to accept the lowest responsive bid from Heartland Kubota, LLC, for the purchase of Four (4) New
Kubota RTV-X1100C Utility Vehicles, for the City of Cheyenne, Community Recreation &
Events Department, for a bid award amount of $134,651.22.

Funding:
022-26-2614-45-43102 (1% Sales Tax 15-18 / Equipment)

$56,961.28

030-17-1754-45-43416 (Special Purpose Option Tax / Greenway Maintenance)
$77,689.94
Total  $134,651.22
```

